{
  "slug": "conductor",
  "name": "Conductor",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Teach Claude to orchestrate microservices and business processes with Conductor. This skill adds full workflow lifecycle management: define workflows with any task type (HTTP, SWITCH, FORK_JOIN, WAIT, HUMAN), run them synchronously or asynchronously, monitor executions, and manage failures with pause/resume/retry/restart.\n\nKey capabilities:\n- Create workflow definitions with proper JSON schema and input expressions\n- Start, monitor, and search workflow executions by status, time, or correlation ID\n- Signal WAIT and HUMAN tasks for human-in-the-loop patterns\n- Scaffold workers in Python, JavaScript, Java, Go, C#, Ruby, or Rust\n- Visualize workflows as Mermaid diagrams\n- Manage multiple environments with CLI profiles\n- Enterprise features: schedules, secrets, webhooks (Orkes)\n\nWorks with any Conductor server — local development or remote. Installs and configures the conductor CLI automatically.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **4 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `conductor` (Create, run, monitor, manage, and review Conductor workflows — including agentic workflows (LLM + MCP + tools))\n- **Commands** (4): `conductor-optimize` (Review and optimize an existing Conductor workflow), `conductor-scaffold-worker` (Generate a Conductor worker stub for a SIMPLE task in your language of choice), `conductor-setup` (First-time Conductor setup — install the CLI, choose a server, configure auth), `conductor` (Conductor command menu — pick a structured action or describe what you want)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install conductor@claude-community` from `conductor-oss/conductor-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
